<title>UK: David S.Smith pretax profits dip in H1.</title>
<headline>David S.Smith pretax profits dip in H1.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year to November 2</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		14.1		   vs 14.6</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 2.6		    vs 2.45</p>
<p> Pretax		     58.6		   vs 59.6</p>
<p> Turnover		   615.4		  vs 612.9</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 52.0 and 58.0 million stg.</p>
<p>Full company name - David S. Smith Plc.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
